          "by": "opus+sonnet",
          "agrees": null,
          "corroborated": true,
          "solution_html": "<p>Suma par: (J+P)+(P+M)+(M+J) = 96+93+97 = 286 = 2(J+P+M), więc J+P+M = 143. Janek = 143 − (P+M) = 143 − 93 = 50 kg.</p>"
        }
      }
    },
